{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01AwJ2UmQAk9N4nUx3V7qCiG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01CsDL1SuXpJHwyQE1CVnT9H","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/juliacosmiano/code/gymnastics-graphics/docs/PRD-7-Team-Audit/implementation-plan.md","old_string":"### Task 5.1: Investigate rotation-slate blank output — NOT STARTED\n\n**Description:** Rotation Slate graphic triggered from producer results in blank output page. The `#output` container is empty.\n**Fixes:** BUG-011","new_string":"### Task 5.1: Investigate rotation-slate blank output — COMPLETE\n\n**Description:** Rotation Slate graphic triggered from producer results in blank output page. The `#output` container is empty.\n\n**Root Cause:** The `rotation-slate` graphic was missing from the `renderers` object in `output.html`. Additionally, the producer sent `rotation-slate` without a rotation number parameter.\n\n**Fix:**\n1. Added `rotation-slate` renderer to `output.html` that embeds the overlay in an iframe (similar to sponsor graphics)\n2. Added `sendRotationSlate(rotation)` function in `GraphicsControl.jsx` to pass rotation number to Firebase\n3. Modified producer UI to show R1-R7 buttons for rotation slate (similar to event summary rotation buttons)\n4. Added rotation `'7'` option to `graphicsRegistry.js` for 7-team competitions\n\n**Files Modified:**\n- `output.html` (line ~10898)\n- `show-controller/src/components/GraphicsControl.jsx`\n- `show-controller/src/lib/graphicsRegistry.js`\n\n**Fixes:** BUG-011"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":853,"cache_read_input_tokens":77829,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":853,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":440,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"590aa6f1-8e43-415b-82c8-e7