{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01L4kDbwYtpvqnSSWZcjZamm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Summary\n\n**Task 5.1: Fix rotation-slate blank output (BUG-011) — COMPLETE**\n\n### Root Cause\nThe `rotation-slate` graphic was missing from the `renderers` object in `output.html`. Additionally, the producer only had a single \"Rotation Slate\" button with no way to specify which rotation number to display.\n\n### Changes Made\n\n1. **output.html** (line ~10898): Added `rotation-slate` renderer that embeds the overlay in an iframe (similar to sponsor graphics pattern)\n\n2. **GraphicsControl.jsx**: \n   - Added `sendRotationSlate(rotation)` function to pass rotation number to Firebase\n   - Modified section rendering to show R1-R7 buttons for rotation slate (same UI pattern as event summary rotation buttons)\n   - Filtered out old single \"Rotation Slate\" button from registry\n\n3. **graphicsRegistry.js**: Added rotation `'7'` option for 7-team competitions\n\n### Verification\n- ✅ Producer shows R1-R7 buttons in \"In-Meet\" section under \"Rotation Slate\"\n- ✅ Clicking R3 displays rotation slate with \"3\" \n- ✅ Clicking R7 displays rotation slate with \"7\"\n- ✅ Graphic renders correctly at 1920x1080 with team logo, meet name, and rotation number\n\n### Remaining Tasks (Phase 5)\n- Task 5.2: Fix Mixed Content errors from VM IP — NOT STARTED\n- Task 5.3: Fix Firebase /alerts permission denied — NOT STARTED"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":86,"cache_read_input_tokens":118099,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":86,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":370,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"590aa6f1-8e43-415b-82c8-e70d72ec9cf6","uuid":"b44fd378-3e03-4e6f-8a8d-85e292e06a02"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":496634,"duration_api_ms":647643,"num_turns":92,"result":"## Summary\n\n**Task 5.1: Fix rotation-slate blank output (BUG-011) — COMPLETE**\n\n### Root Cause\nThe `rotation-slate` graphic was missing from the `renderers` object in `output.html`. Additionally, the producer only had a single \"Rotation Slate\" button with no way to specify which rotation number to display.\n\n### Changes Made\n\n1. **output.html** (line ~10898): Added `rotation-slate` renderer that embeds the overlay in an iframe (similar to sponsor graphics pattern)\n\n2. **GraphicsControl.jsx**: \n   - Added `sendRotationSlate(rotation)` function to pass rotation number to Firebase\n   - Modified section rendering to show R1-R7 buttons for rotation slate (same UI pattern as event summary rotation buttons)\n   - Filtered out old single \"Rotation Slate\" button from registry\n\n3. **graphicsRegistry.js**: Added rotation `'7'` option for 7-team competitions\n\n### Verification\n- ✅ Producer shows R1-R7 buttons in \"In-Meet\" section under \"Rotation Slate\"\n- ✅ Clicking R3 displays rotation slate with \"3\" \n- ✅ Clicking R7 displays rotation slate with \"7\"\n- ✅ Graphic renders correctly at 1920x1080 with team logo, meet name, and rotation number\n\n### Remaining Tasks (Phase 5)\n- Task 5.2: Fix Mixed Content errors from VM IP — NOT STARTED\n- Task 5.3: Fix Firebase /alerts permission denied — NOT STARTED","session_id":"590aa6f1-8e43-415b-82c8-e70d72ec9cf6","total_cost_usd":4.95531425,"usage":{"input_tokens":1692,"cache_creation_input_tokens":99309,"cache_read_input_tokens":6672567,"output_tokens":18255,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":99309}},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":16422,"outputTokens":492,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":6849,"webSearchRequests":